      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name} maybe you could try moving it from VRChat/Mobile/Particles to VRChat/Particles, that way it's not present in the Mobile hierarchy? It would also remove any kind of confusion about the shader being usable or not. Also I noted that it's whitelisted for upload on IOS avatars.",
