      "value": "@{63691297469f06772579fe6f|full_name} You are objectively incorrect. Transparency *is* supported for **particles** which this shader is under (`VRChat/Mobile/Particles`).\n\nMultiply, and Additive, both work on Quest when used with a particle system.\n\nI've opened a separate feedback on this since it's specifically pertaining to particle systems. The error **is to be expected when used on a mesh renderer.**\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/sdk-bug-reports/p/alphablended-on-particles-not-android-compatible-despite-in-vrchat-mobile-catego",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
